cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the World Historical Gazetteer platform, please cite it as below."
title: "World Historical Gazetteer: Web Platform & API"
abstract: >-
  An open-source platform for linking, visualising, and sharing data about
  historical places. Built with Python/Django and PostgreSQL/PostGIS, WHG
  provides researchers and institutions with tools for uploading and
  reconciling historical place data against global authorities, collaborative
  curation with provenance tracking, spatial-temporal visualisation, and
  programmatic access via a REST API and a W3C-conformant Reconciliation
  Service API.
type: software
